<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>As the Israelites did offer</l><l>From the surplus of their land,</l><l>Thus some produce reaped of Jesus</l><l>Must be in our serving hand.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We on Christ, as land, must labor,</l><l>Harvest Him for all our fare;</l><l>Tasting Him to overflowing,</l><l>Christ with others we may share.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Holding Christ, as members growing,</l><l>Each his function must observe;</l><l>Christ receiving, Christ partaking,</l><l>To His Body Christ we serve.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Fellowship and testimony,</l><l>Ministry and worship too,</l><l>In all helps and ministrations</l><l>Christ is all our service true.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
